+/*                                                                         */
+/*    Type 1 objects manager (specification).                              */
+/*                                                                         */
+/*  Copyright 1996-2001, 2002, 2006 by                                     */
+/*  David Turner, Robert Wilhelm, and Werner Lemberg.                      */
